#____________________________________________________________________________________________
# set_rt_thread_priority
# Scheduling of the threads that receive RT data and run RT callbacks, applied from the next connect_rt_control.
# Linux: policy 1 (SCHED_FIFO) or 2 (SCHED_RR) with priority 1-99, or 0 (SCHED_OTHER) with priority 0. policy -1 restores the default.
# Fails while the RT stream is connected.
#____________________________________________________________________________________________

int32      policy
int32      priority
---
bool       success
